abstract: >-
  SKOS thesaurus of the objects, materials, rooms, livestock, personal roles
  and properties recorded in historical inventories of Tyrolean castles and
  residences. Concepts carry German and English preferred labels, historical
  spellings from the sources, definitions from the Inventaria glossary, and
  links to the DARIAH Backbone Thesaurus, the Getty AAT, Wikidata and the
  Library of Congress.
keywords:
